I am working with an STM32C542 processor using STM32CubeMX2 and the new HAL2 library framework. CubeMX2 generated the code and I imported the CMake project into STM32CubeIDE v 2.1.1.

I am trying to configure Timer 2 for a basic 1-second interrupt to toggle an LED, but the callback function is never reached. Here is the initialization generated by CubeMX2 in mx\_tim2.c:

